/v1/","context":{"app_id":4560260,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4560260-1847286114042572","game_id":"steam-4560260","kind":"announcement","title":"Notice to all guests: Next Fest closes tomorrow","summary":"NOTICE TO ALL GUESTS Steam Next Fest closes tomorrow. Management thanks every guest who entered the pools this week. The demo area will remain open after the festival. Guests who did not visit may still do so. Swim at your own risk. No exceptions. Play the free demo The remaining areas open on 22 January 2027. Guests wishing to be informed may register their interest via the wishlist. Wishlist Backrooms Anomaly: Pools Days without accidents: 00 From us, out of character: thank you for playing, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042572","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:09:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4560260-1847286114040133","game_id":"steam-4560260","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: the anomaly almost nobody found","summary":"Before the demo came out, one of its anomalies was a door handle that had been flipped the wrong way round. We thought it was fair. You disagreed: only 8% of players spotted it the first time, and most never did. So on 10 October we replaced it with a fire hose in the maintenance room. That turned out to be nearly as hard. In the first few days, 1 in 10 of you caught it on the first try. On 14 October we made the change easier to see. Since then, 49% of players spot it the first time they meet i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T17:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040133","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:15:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4560260-1847286114037231","game_id":"steam-4560260","kind":"announcement","title":"Coming from Backrooms Anomaly? Here's what's different in Pools","summary":"If you played Backrooms Anomaly, you already know the rule: look for anything that's off, turn back if something changed, keep going if nothing did. Pools keeps that rule and moves it somewhere much wetter. The poolrooms. Tiled corridors, flooded chambers and empty pools instead of yellow wallpaper and carpet. Two stages. The Detection Stage is the hunt you know. Clear it and the Survival Stage starts: several anomalies can appear at once, and you have to photograph them before time runs out. If","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:01:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037231","verified_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4560260-1847286114032451","game_id":"steam-4560260","kind":"announcement","title":"755 players. What got you?","summary":"Thanks to everyone who has gone into the poolrooms since the demo came out on 16 October. 755 of you have played so far, and between you you've made just over 16,000 calls. We went through the numbers to see which anomalies people walk straight past. The easy ones Almost everyone spots the giant statue head on the first try (90%), and the colourful slides aren't far behind (88%). Fair enough. They're not subtle. The ones that get you The hardest anomaly in the demo is the thing on the ceiling: o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:31:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032451","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:46:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4560260-1846651706683035","game_id":"steam-4560260","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out! We're joining Steam Next Fest","summary":"The free demo for Backrooms Anomaly: Pools is available now! We're also taking part in Steam Next Fest from 19 to 26 October, so you can get into the poolrooms before the festival begins. https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4560260/8ff5deb062ad4cf291e26816b951539ac3123f0b/ss_8ff5deb062ad4cf291e26816b951539ac3123f0b.1920x1080.jpg Pools is the sequel to Backrooms Anomaly, taking the anomaly hunt into tiled corridors, flooded chambers and empty pools. Learn the space,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T20:37:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4560260-1836506165553537","game_id":"steam-4560260","kind":"announcement","title":"Our new game Backrooms Anomaly launches July 24","summary":"Hey everyone! Backrooms Anomaly: Pools is the sequel to Backrooms Anomaly, so this is the best place to start. Backrooms Anomaly launches July 24 with a 30% launch discount. If you're interested in Pools, wishlist this one now so you get notified when it goes live. It's a horror game about hunting anomalies. You work your way through the levels watching for anything that looks off, and getting back out is the hard part. We put most of our effort into the atmosphere, and that's what we think will","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T11:06:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165553537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4560260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4560260":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4560260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5113740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4560260","app_id":4560260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:41Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"955320eb5612ee0068d0f90f79685d6e0c62f68437a8d82ae55eb4b121e23fb7","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"끝없이 반복되는 리미널한 풀룸을 배경으로 한 이상 현상 찾기 공포 게임입니다. 주변을 살피며 미세한 변화부터 공포스러운 존재까지 찾아내세요. 달라진 것이 있으면 되돌아가고, 모든 것이 정상이라면 계속 나아가세요. 그다음에는 카메라로 이상 현상을 기록하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"liminal_games","creator_clan_account_id":45186270}],"developers":[{"name":"liminal_games","creator_clan_account_id":45186270}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1800640800,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Gameplay trailer - Korean","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792145277","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4560260/106523543/cedf5bea2b82ba094bb1447894eaf5ddf6b0c86c/1792143599/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4560260/106523543/cedf5bea2b82ba094bb1447894eaf5ddf6b0c86c/1792143599/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4560260/106523543/cedf5bea2b82ba094bb1447894eaf5ddf6b0c86c/1792143